    "directions": [
      "In a kadai or pan, add the, once it’s hot, add gram flour and roast well for 7-8 minutes on low flame.",
      "Add ghee and mix it well, add milk powder, desiccated coconut and cook it for 2-3 minutes.",
      "Add milk in small batches and stir it with the help of whisk to avoid the lumps.",
      "Add saffron water, castor sugar and cook it for a while until it binds well.",
      "Finish it with the milk and cook it for a minute on medium flames.",
      "Transfer it to a bowl, add cardamom powder and mix it well.",
      "Keep it aside to cool down at room temperature.",
      "Divide the mixture into lemon size balls and give it a desired shape.",
      "Transfer it on a serving platter or dish.",
      "In a pan, add sugar, water and cook well until it turns grainy in texture.",
      "Transfer it to a bowl or tray and keep it aside to cool.",
      "Sieve the sugar with the help of a strainer and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a kadai, add ghee, once it’s hot, add mawa and cook it well until mawa turns grainy or mixture starts leaving the pan.",
      "Transfer it to a tray and keep it aside to cool down at room temperature.",
      "Transfer it to a parat and knead it well until smooth.",
      "Add prepared muscovado sugar and mix it well.",
      "Divide the mixture into lemon size balls and give it a desired shape.",
      "Make a thumb imprint on the peda and transfer it to a serving platter or dish.",
      "Garnish it with green cardamom seeds and serve."
    ],
